{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:0.2", "PA_ja_125:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Kusanāḷivagga (The Chapter on the Kusa Reed)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:0.4"], "en": "5. The Kaṭāhaka Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:1.1", "PA_ja_125:1.2"], "en": "“Though he might boast at great length, having gone to another land;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:1.3"], "en": "\"Having followed after, he might defile you;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:1.4"], "en": "enjoy your wealth, O frying pans!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_125:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fifth Jātaka, the Kaṭāhaka-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
